<title>JAPAN: Takeda Machinery -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takeda Machinery -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.42		vs	    1.35</p>
<p> Operating   loss 252    million	  vs   loss 345    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 275    million	  vs   loss 299    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 282    million	  vs   loss 267    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 27.71 yen	  vs    loss 26.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Takeda Machinery Co Ltd is the second largest steel frame processing machinery maker.</p>
